   "title": "read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## track what moves, draw it as a diagram\n\n**You need:** nothing to try it (the tracker runs a built-in sample clip). For your own footage put a\n*Load Video* on the tracker's `video`. People and things need a YOLO file in models/ultralytics, body / hands /\nface need MediaPipe, a clicked motif and exact outlines need SAM 2 in models/sam2: nothing is downloaded.\n\n**Do:** on *kubakub tracker* pick what to find on the pills (motion, colour, lights, people & things, body,\nhands, face, motif, outlines; several at once) and Queue. The node shows the video with what it found.\nScrub to a frame and press **try this frame** to see a change of settings on that frame in a second.\n\n**The look:** *kubakub track draw* plays the look live as soon as the tracker has run: start from a preset\n(diagnostic, constellation, stamp trail), then **edit the look**: marks on every thing (box, brackets, outline,\ncircle, cross, dot, labels with live values or your own state words, skeleton), lines between them (nearest,\nwithin a distance, network, tree, hull, hub, chain, trail, to the corners of the biggest), what happens inside\nthem (reveal, pixels, freeze, invert) and the stamp trail. Queue to render it at full size.\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## track what moves, draw it as a diagram\n\n**You need:** nothing to try it (the tracker runs a built-in sample clip). For your own footage put a\n*Load Video* on the tracker's `video`. People and things need a YOLO file in models/ultralytics, body / hands /\nface need MediaPipe, a clicked motif and exact outlines need SAM 2 in models/sam2: nothing is downloaded.\n\n**Do:** on *kubakub tracker* pick what to find on the pills (motion, colour, lights, people & things, body,\nhands, face, motif, outlines; several at once) and Queue. The node shows the video with what it found.\nScrub to a frame and press **try this frame** to see a change of settings on that frame in a second.\n\n**The look:** *kubakub track draw* plays the look live as soon as the tracker has run: start from a preset\n(diagnostic, constellation, stamp trail), then **edit the look**: marks on every thing (box, brackets, outline,\ncircle, cross, dot, labels with live values or your own state words, skeleton), lines between them (nearest,\nwithin a distance, network, tree, hull, hub, chain, trail, to the corners of the biggest), what happens inside\nthem (reveal, pixels, freeze, invert) and the stamp trail. Queue to render it at full size.\n"
   },
